WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.412 --> 00:00:04.428
Unit three. Community and Public Health!

2
00:00:05.384 --> 00:00:10.451
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:10.501 --> 00:00:13.540
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:18.100
Today we learn about Community and Public Health. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.773 --> 00:00:22.707
Public health. Say it with me. Public health!

6
00:00:26.258 --> 00:00:32.091
Community health worker. Say it with me. Community health worker!

7
00:00:35.599 --> 00:00:39.733
Sanitation. Say it with me. Sanitation!

8
00:00:43.198 --> 00:00:47.631
Health education. Say it with me. Health education!

9
00:00:51.169 --> 00:00:55.903
Disease surveillance. Say it with me. Disease surveillance!

10
00:00:59.412 --> 00:01:03.962
Health equity. Say it with me. Health equity!

11
00:01:07.465 --> 00:01:12.148
Access to care. Say it with me. Access to care!

12
00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:20.341
Preventive care. Say it with me. Preventive care!

13
00:01:23.838 --> 00:01:41.158
Public health focuses on keeping a whole community healthy, not just one person. A community health worker supports sanitation, health education, and disease surveillance. Health equity means everyone deserves access to preventive care.

14
00:01:41.208 --> 00:01:44.484
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:45.204 --> 00:01:50.569
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:50.619 --> 00:01:51.913
Sanitation!

17
00:01:53.169 --> 00:01:58.437
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:58.487 --> 00:01:59.939
Access to care!

19
00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:09.753
Did you know? Improvements in sanitation, like clean water access, have saved more lives throughout history than most medicines.

20
00:02:09.803 --> 00:02:12.117
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:13.137 --> 00:02:22.511
Think and answer. Why does public health matter for an entire community?

22
00:02:22.561 --> 00:02:23.749
Great answer!

23
00:02:24.778 --> 00:02:30.122
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:30.172 --> 00:02:32.976
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

